<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:
AR-SA">Please contact National Funding. There is still
time left to resolve your account. If we do not hear from you, the account will
be reported to business credit as a delinquent account and will be referred to our
Legal Department for possible litigation. If you are unable to maintain the
full payments at this time, we do have modification programs available and
would like to work with you to resolve the delinquency. Please
contact us at the number below to do so.</span></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div><